[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ、はあ……なんで負けなきゃいけないのさ……\nこんな中途半端な奴らに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huff... huff... Why did we have to go and lose... to those two wishy-washy guys of all people!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何が……兄様たちを、そこまで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What could possibly drive you both... to go so far..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "意地、だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pride."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そこまで言うなら、お好きにしてください。\n撤退しましょう、シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you insist on being so stubborn, then do as you please. We're withdrawing, Citrine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく、もうちょっとお利口に\n立ち回ってもらいたいもんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly, I'd appreciate it if you could be a little bit more sensible about how you handle things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……だああ、強かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man, you were both so strong!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっはっは。よく踏ん張った。\nゴゥも意地を張れるようになったじゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahahaha! You really held your ground there. Look at you, Gou—my stubbornness has rubbed off on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉上の言っていた、粋というものが……\nなんとなく、私にも分かってきました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That chic thing you were talking about... I think I'm starting to understand it a little."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナくんたちと出会ってから、自分のしていることが\n気になってモヤモヤすることが多かったのですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ever since I met Resna and the others, I've been feeling conflicted about what I've been doing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今日の行動には、悔いはありません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I have no regrets about what we did today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて、気持ちいいんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It feels... amazing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふ……そうさね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh... yeah, it does, doesn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今の私たち、最高にかっこよくないですか、姉上",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We look pretty darn cool right now, don't we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あっはっは！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ahahaha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……最高にかっこいいとも！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... we look amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それから……アタシたちは、\n\u3000アルビーに連絡を取った）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After that... we contacted Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（手に入れた仙人の実で、島の住人たちを救う薬を\n\u3000錬金術で作るためだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We needed her to use alchemy to create medicine from the Sage Fruit we'd obtained to save the island's residents."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（決定的に対立した今、アタシたちはもう\n\u3000きょうだいたちの手を借りることはできないだろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that we've crossed swords, we couldn't rely on our siblings' help anymore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナたちは突然の訪問に驚いていたが、\n\u3000キカイ島の事情を聞いて協力を申し出てくれた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna and the others were surprised by our sudden visit, but when they heard about the situation on Kikai Island, they offered to help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（土下座でも何でもするつもりだったが……\n\u3000本当に粋なヤツらだよ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was prepared to get down on my hands and knees and beg if I had to... but they really are chic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（みんなからしたらアタシたちは敵であるはずなのに、\n\u3000こうして受け入れてくれるんだから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To them, we should have been enemies, yet they welcomed us with open arms."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そしてついに……島の住人を救う薬が、完成した）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And finally... the medicine to save the island's residents was completed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一週間後――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One week later—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "モノローグ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monologue"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお、姉上！\u3000キカイ島の皆の様子はどうでした？\n玉涎香の毒気は！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sister! How are the people on Kikai Island doing? What about the toxins from the Jade Incense?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すっかり抜けたみたいだよ。\nみんな穏やかに暮らしてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all cleared out of their systems. Everyone's living peacefully now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうですか……！\u3000それは良かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?! That's wonderful!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっちはどうだい？\u3000キカイ島のみんなの移住を\n鏑矢に進言する……その内容はまとまったのかい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about your end? Have you finished putting together your proposal to Kaburaya about relocating everyone from Kikai Island?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんです！\u3000ケイウンでの礼儀というものも\n少し学んできました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! I even learned a bit about proper etiquette in Keiun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうやらハラキリというものが最大級の誠意を\n見せるものらしいです。いざというときは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apparently, something called 'harakiri' is their ultimate form of showing sincerity. If it comes to that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや……違うと思うよ？\u3000やめておきな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That doesn't sound right. Please don't."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうですか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... okay then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく……だが、その意気や良し。\nアタシたちは、自分で粋だと思えることをしていこう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good grief... I admire your spirit. Let's keep doing what we think is chic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行くよ、ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Gou."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、姉上",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right, Sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]